[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Vircom\The 4th Coming Server\Contact]

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Vircom\The 4th Coming Server\ExtensionDLLs]

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Vircom\The 4th Coming Server\GeneralConfig]

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Vircom\The 4th Coming Server\Logging]

